DEPT® is a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, our 4,000+ specialists deliver growth invention services across Brand &amp; Media, Experience, Commerce, CRM, and Technology &amp; Data. We’re 50|50 tech and marketing, partner-led, and first to move. Clients include Google, Lufthansa, Meta, eBay, and OpenAI. We have been certified B Corp and Climate Neutral since 2021.

JOB PURPOSE

Our Paid Search (SEA) consultants team is working on helping our clients developing and increasing their online businesses. First and foremost, you’ll set up, manage and optimise Paid Search campaigns. Moreover, you also act as a business partner for our clients! This means that you’re thinking with the client and you’re consulting them based on marketing needs, challenging their goals, assessing feasibility and carrying on with a resolution.

WHAT YOU’LL DO

• Manage multi-market paid search and shopping campaigns for clients;

• Conduct keyword research and analysis to identify relevant search terms and opportunities for campaign optimisation;

• Lean into automation and use of data within campaigns, including utilising AI to improve performance;

• Create and optimize paid search campaigns across various platforms, such as Google Ads and Bing Ads;

• Monitor campaign performance, analyse data, and provide regular reports to clients, highlighting key metrics and recommendations for improvement;

• Stay up-to-date with industry trends and best practices in paid search advertising;

• Collaborate with cross-functional teams to ensure seamless execution of campaigns and alignment with client goals;

• Stay informed about changes in search engine algorithms and adjust strategies accordingly;

• Carry out technical analysis, content &amp; authority analysis;

• Set up implementation plans and workflows;

• Respond to client (internal and external) briefs;

• Report on activity on weekly, monthly and quarterly basis;

• Have a direct client communication.

WHAT YOU BRING

• Prior experience (at least 2 years) in managing and optimising paid search &amp; shopping campaigns, preferably within a digital agency or similar environment;

• Strong knowledge of paid search platforms, such as Google Ads and Bing Ads;

• Experience with client communication;

• Excellent analytical skills and ability to interpret data to drive campaign optimisation;

• Ability to work collaboratively in a fast-paced, deadline-driven environment;

• Intermediate or higher proficiency in the use of Excel/Sheets and familiarity with Word/Docs and PowerPoint/Slides;

• Excellent time management and organisational skills with a high attention to detail;

• Ability to react quickly within a fast-paced environment;

• Coaching more junior team members is considered as a plus;

• Directly available to start working from our Skopje office;

• Full working proficiency in the English language

WE OFFER
Please note that benefits may vary by location. Feel free to reach out to your recruiter for more details

• Hybrid working policy

• A reputation for doing good. DEPT® has been a Certified B Corp® since 2021 .

• Awesome clients. Whether big, small, local or global - at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with all of them. And we celebrate all of our successes together!

• The opportunity for possibility. We want to enable you to do what you do best and help you develop your skills further with training, development and certifications.

• Global annual DEPT® Cares Month in which employees come together and donate their skills to support local charities.

